flowchart TB
  W["Dashboard widget<br/>metric_key + optional pinned_version"] --> POL{"Dashboard version_policy"}
  POL -->|"latest_published (default)"| LIVE["Use the snapshot of metric.published_version<br/>(the live definition)"]
  POL -->|pinned| PIN["Use the snapshot of the chosen version number<br/>(must exist in metric_versions)"]
  LIVE --> SNAP["Version snapshot (immutable)"]
  PIN --> SNAP
  SNAP --> RUN["Compile + run formula (+ filters + time window)"]
  EDIT["Analyst edits a published metric"] --> DRAFT["New draft version<br/>live version unchanged,<br/>dashboards keep their numbers"]
  PUBN["Reviewer publishes the new version"] --> LIVE2["Latest-published dashboards switch<br/>pinned dashboards do not"]
